@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Shorten
POST {{base}}/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://www.jusbrasil.com.br" }

### Shorten with expiration
POST {{base}}/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://www.jusbrasil.com.br/jurisprudencia", "expiresAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z" }

### Invalid scheme → 400
POST {{base}}/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "ftp://example.com" }

### Redirect (replace the code)
GET {{base}}/REPLACE
Referer: https://google.com

### List
GET {{base}}/api/urls

### Stats (replace the code)
GET {{base}}/api/stats/REPLACE

### Analytics page (open in a browser)
GET {{base}}/analytics/REPLACE
